<BaseLayout title="Technical reference">
  <h1>Technical reference</h1>
  <p>This section collects identification, system descriptions, electrical references, and diagnostic procedures. Confirm technical data against the vehicle's VIN, market, engine, transmission, and option codes.</p>
  <h2>Reference pages</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="../technical/engine-and-drivetrain/">Engine and drivetrain identification</a></li>
    <li><a href="../technical/fuses/">Fuse locations and safe replacement</a></li>
    <li><a href="../technical/diagnostics/">OBD-II and diagnostic codes</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Vehicle identification checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Full VIN (keep private; do not publish it on the public website).</li>
    <li>Engine designation and engine serial/build details where available.</li>
    <li>Transmission code and drivetrain configuration.</li>
    <li>Market, option codes, and brake package.</li>
    <li>Software version and relevant control-module identifiers when diagnosing faults.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Do not publish personal identifiers, registration details, or a complete VIN in a public repository.</p>
</BaseLayout>
